> How do you send this kind of header when sending a mail to the list
> using thunderbird/icedove for example?

Install the mnenhy extension [ http://mnenhy.mozdev.org/ ]; edit its
preferences and make X-No-Archive available for the Compose window; add
the header just like you'd add a CC or a BCC.



